Z||000014||TI_3VOM||09-01-2001||03:50 PM||||lessee...<BR>Groceries...no prob, as long as I am alone. Just put some bags in the trunk, and a few in the passenger seat/floor. And watch those eggs.<BR>Big Screen TV...depends on how big. OK, so nothing over 25 inches. Again, pax seat, all the way back, and maybe leave the pax window down. Makes for some akward moments, though.<BR>Pick Up Two Girls...put 'em both in the pax seat. Just don't drive on rough surfaces or for two long a time. Helps if they're really friendly.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Sex...both of you gotta be limber, and an open sunroof definately helps.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Dead Body...one word: blender. OK, two more words: Ziplock Bags<BR>Threesome...ok, so there are some things you can't do in a Fiero. <P><BR>||||reg||5
